  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indian Ocean and IORA 2022-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funding under this investment will boost growth and prosperity in the Indian Ocean region and contribute to Australian engagement in the Indian Ocean Rim Association (IORA). The Fund will provide support to activities that focus on IORA&#x2019;s priorities, including fisheries management, maritime safety and security, trade and investment facilitation, academic and scientific cooperation, disaster risk management, tourism and cultural exchanges and women&apos;s economic empowerment.</narrative>
  </description>
